      "comment": "RED REIGN (8) is an honest type in the frame at two of nine starts including five wins, the latest scoring (22.73) over 400m at The Gardens. Boxed wide but will go close with the right run. WRECK IT REX (7) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by a neck at The Gardens in a handy 23.19 beating Coco Bella. Can make it two on the bounce. BOLD CHARM (1) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when second (22.80) in a Grade 5 at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. BOMBAY (2) warrants respect with the drop in trip.",
